      "sketch": "Create four new classes in the same application layer:\n\n- OrderLifecycleService handling place, fetch, cancel, close, order_count, orders_for, open_orders, line_count, revenue, tier_summary.\n- PricingService handling set_discount, discount_for, bulk_discount, set_tax_rate, apply_tax, total_for, policy_rate, is_priced.\n- AuditService handling log, history, last_entry, audit_size, clear_audit.\n- NotificationService handling notify, sent_count, reset_sent.\n\nEach new service receives only the collaborators it needs (e.g., OrderLifecycleService gets repository, NotificationService gets notifier). The original OrderService becomes a thin façade delegating to these services or can be removed.\n\nAll new classes stay in the `application` layer and continue to import only domain objects, preserving the architectural rule.",
