      "sketch": "Introduce a new domain class `PricingPolicy` (in the domain layer) that encapsulates discount tables, tax rate, and calculation methods (`set_discount`, `discount_for`, `bulk_discount`, `set_tax_rate`, `apply_tax`, `total_for`, `is_priced`). `PricingService` (or the existing OrderService) would depend on this policy instead of holding the raw attributes. This reduces the number of attributes accessed directly by the service, improving cohesion.\n\nOnly the domain layer imports `PricingPolicy`; the application layer continues to import domain as allowed.",
