  "risk_notes": "Splitting the class introduces new public interfaces; existing code that directly instantiated OrderService may need to be updated to use the new façade or individual services. Care must be taken to preserve transaction boundaries and ordering of side‑effects (e.g., audit logging after a state change). Unit tests should be updated to reflect the new composition. The increase in DCC is expected but should be monitored to avoid excessive coupling."
